@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics for Clients" as FAFR003
  usecase "CFR002: Receive Alerts on Anomalous Transactions" as CFR002
  usecase "CFR006: Manage Spending Limit Alerts" as CFR006
  usecase "SFR014: Generate Client Analytics for Financial Performance" as SFR014
  usecase "AIFR007: Generate Contextualized News Insights" as AIFR007

  client --> CFR001 : View financial data consolidated in a dashboard.
  client --> FAFR003 : Receive predictive analytics about clients' financial situations during consultations.
  client --> CFR002 : Get alerts on anomalous transactions to identify potential fraud or unusual spending patterns.
  client --> SFR014 : Access detailed performance analysis of their finances over time.
  client --> AIFR007 : Stay informed with relevant market news tied to personal investments.

  sysadmin --> SAFR001 : Adjust parameters for the AI system ensuring accuracy and compliance (e.g., Basel III).
  
  advisor --> FAFR002 : View intervention alerts when clients need professional attention.
  advisor --> FAFR003 : Review predictive analytics before advising on financial decisions.

  client <|-- CFR005: Manage preferences for personalized recommendations to align with KYC data and risk tolerance.
}

@enduml